[14359]="7003A6EB\n1\tDefeat Nûdît\tNûdît can be found on the plains to the north of Entwade.\n2\tDefeat Nûdît\tNûdît can be found on the plains to the north of Entwade. You have encountered the mighty Uruk-hai, Nûdît, and his warband. You should defeat him before his forces reach Entwade.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have defeated Nûdît, and spared Entwade another brutal assault.\n",
