[14367]="700385AA\n1\tFind Rog-votak\tRog-votak leads a strong band of riders that are a part of the White Hand army within Madh-fushaum in the southern Stonedeans.\n2\tDefeat Rog-votak\tRog-votak leads a strong band of riders that are a part of the White Hand army within Madh-fushaum in the southern Stonedeans.\n3\tCompletado\tRog-votak and his band are no longer another threat posed by the army within Madh-fushaum.\n",
